# untranspiled ES2021/ES2022 syntax (class `static {}` blocks, `??=`/`||=`/`&&=`)
# was shipping in framework chunks (e.g. next/error) and throwing
# `SyntaxError: Unexpected token '{'` on iOS < 16.4 — breaking hydration and the
# homepage "enter" gate. Targeting iOS 13.4 forces those down to ES2020.
# 13.4 is the practical floor: Turbopack's own runtime uses optional chaining
# (Safari 13.1+), so we cannot truthfully support anything older.
